<span class="cat-badge">Guide &middot; Pricing</span>
<h1>Honda Wave Daily Rental Price in Hanoi: Cost Planning Guide</h1>
<p>The Honda Wave is the workhorse of Vietnamese traffic, and in Hanoi it rents at a verified 150,000 VND per day. This guide plans the daily budget around that number honestly: what the daily rate includes, when a daily rental is the right choice, when it stops being the right choice, and how the day rate connects to the weekly and monthly rates for the same machine.</p>
<p>We cover the verified price and what it buys, the cost profile of the Wave against other models in the fleet, day-by-day budget planning, the break-even points against the 700,000 VND weekly rate and the 900,000 to 1,200,000 VND monthly rate, and the questions that settle extras like deposits and gear. Start at the <a href="/hanoi-motorbike-rental-cost/">Hanoi motorbike rental cost</a> hub, see the wider model range at the <a href="/hanoi-motorbike-rental/">Hanoi motorbike rental</a> guide, and check common questions on the <a href="/faq/">rental FAQ</a>.</p>
